{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Pangu AI 是一款把私隱放在首位的人工智能助理，對話、文件與語音預設全部在 iPhone 裝置內處理，適合注重資料自主的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。若需要更快的反應與更強能力，可在設定中自行開啟雲端 AI，並隨時切回全離線模式。</p>\n\n<h2>離線對話與文件問答</h2>\n<p>Pangu AI 預設在 iPhone 上離線運行，對話、文件與語音都在裝置內處理，不會上傳至任何 AI 服務。你可匯入 PDF 與檔案並以日常語言提問，它會在本機進行語意搜尋，從文件中找出相關段落作答，找不到時亦會如實說明。語音對話與喚醒詞同樣在裝置內完成。設定中可自行開啟雲端 AI，亦可隨時切回全離線模式。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Pangu AI</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T06:11:42.732269+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}